<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-HOIU PRIVATE LOANS EXCEED ONE BLN EEK.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-HOIU PRIVATE LOANS EXCEED ONE BLN EEK.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hoiupank's loan portfolio to private persons has exceeded one billion kroons, the bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>The number of private persons having taken loans from Hoiupank rose 56.1 percent over the first quarter, the bank added in a statement.</p>
<p>Hoiupank's share of the loan market to individual clients was 44.7 percent as of the end of March, it said.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
